     "body": "<p>Turns out this already existed:</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/blob/main/fcrepo-configs/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/config/DatabaseConfig.java#L65\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/blob/main/fcrepo-configs/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/config/DatabaseConfig.java#L65</a> </p>\n\n<p>But was not documented. I have added an entry for it to <a href=\"https://wiki.lyrasis.org/display/FEDORA6x/Properties\" title=\"smart-link\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://wiki.lyrasis.org/display/FEDORA6x/Properties</a> </p>",
